{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562230/extras/banner.png?t=1742979303\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Another busy day at the office, and you\u2019re one cute, cheeky dog!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ruff Day At The Office is a delightfully funny game where you turn a cozy corporate world into a hilarious mess.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What You\u2019ll Find:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mischievous office dog (that's you)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An office full of humans just trying to work (you don't care)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plenty of desks to disrupt and snacks to steal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Computers that were working just fine (until you showed up)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb from the lobby to the top management CEO\u2019s office through a stack of crazy levels! Every floor brings new office vibes, tougher chaos to spark, and tons of funny stuff to uncover as you climb the building.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562230/extras/transparent.gif?t=1742979303\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Say hello to Mochi, the office\u2019s newest hire: adorable, unstoppable, and here to make every day a ruff one. Wishlist now for a dose of playful chaos!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3562230?t=1742979303","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3562230?t=1742979303","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562230/3d107efeab5c8d3c23ae0a681bbca2f34625bdb4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742979303","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akama